					"content": "現在離開還太早了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410710,
					"content": "嗯！我們應該像之前一樣，幫她一把，讓她更快地突破這場考驗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410711,
					"content": "有沒有辦法縮短她在裡面的時間，或者直接幫她獲得勝利？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410712,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410713,
					"content": "再怎麼說也不能讓影在裡面出什麼意外吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410714,
					"content": "可是，這個地方不讓我們進去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410715,
					"content": "想要幫她，怎麼都要先進去才行。怎麼辦，怎麼辦，要不要撞一下試試…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410716,
					"content": "去找八重神子吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410717
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410717,
					"content": "對哦！忘了還有她呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410718,
					"content": "不知道她對這些莫名其妙的空間瞭解多少…但我們也沒有其他選擇了。啊——走吧走吧，上山去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410709,
					"content": "我們的工作還沒結束。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410705,
					"content": "但這應該不是唯一的辦法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410706
					]
				}
			]
		},
